# tanmatra — nuclear data: AME2020, charge radii, moments, superallowed ft, shell-model levels, model coefficients
#
# GENERATED by scripts/oracle from tanmatra 1.3.0 (rust-old/), libm 0.2.16. Do not edit.
# Regenerate: cargo run --release --locked --manifest-path scripts/oracle/Cargo.toml
#
# Public tables are enumerated through the oracle's API. The private coefficients and level
# orders are extracted from rust-old/src/nucleus.rs and proven against the oracle over the
# whole M2 grid before this file is written (scripts/oracle/src/t_nucleus.rs).
# tests/golden/nucleus.tsv pins every value's use.

# Bethe–Weizsäcker coefficients (MeV): least-squares fit to the 2484 AME2020 binding
# energies with A >= 16 (rust-old/src/nucleus.rs A_V .. A_P).
